Manual registration steps (apply these carefully):

1. In firmware/src/core.h change:
   #define NENGINES (13 + FELUCCA_SLICE)
   to:
   #define NENGINES (14 + FELUCCA_SLICE)
   and add:
   #define ENGI_PINHEAD 14u

2. In firmware/src/engines.c after the other includes add:
   #include "pinhead/eng_pinhead.c"

3. In the ENGINES[] array append:
   &ENG_PINHEAD,                 /* 14 */

4. In ENGINE_ORDER[] append the index 14 (or place it where you want it in the browsing order).

After these edits the engine list will show PINHEAD and note_on/render will call the DSP engine.
